{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_01",
      "hash": "263ce8ccadf90788",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：啊！找到你了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_06",
      "hash": "263cefccadf9136d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我就觉得你差不多也\\n应该到红莲道馆了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_07",
      "hash": "263ceeccadf911ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你赢过了夏伯？\\n……是嘛。祝贺你了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_02",
      "hash": "263cebccadf90ca1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "参加宝可梦联盟\\n需要[VAR COLOR(0006)]８个[VAR COLOR(0000)]道馆徽章吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_08",
      "hash": "263ce1ccadf8fba3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我现在有７个！\\n于是剩下的就是……"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_03",
      "hash": "263ceaccadf90aee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "果然只剩[VAR COLOR(0006)]常青市[VAR COLOR(0000)]的道馆了吧？\\n我之前去的时候，里面没有人呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_04",
      "hash": "263cedccadf91007",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n你已经去过常青道馆了？\\r\\n应该还没去吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_05",
      "hash": "263cecccadf90e54",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我要不要\\n再去常青市看看呢？"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_1110_max",
      "hash": "ecef777532caf5fc"
    }
  ]
}
